	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Ego, reverende in Christo pater, quod scribam, non habeo; <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>novi enim ad nos ex <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> nihil affertur.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Gallica te ex <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>d. <persName ref="p613">Coignetio</persName> intelligere arbitror; scripsit enim ipse <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>superiori septimana ad nostrum legatum et inter <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>alia meminit matrimonii initi aut ineundi certe <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>inter <persName>Carolum</persName>, imperatoris filium, et <persName ref="p18554">reginam Angliae</persName>.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z7"/>Addit <placeName ref="l749">Saxonem</placeName>, captivi filium, ingentes cogere copias, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>item spem aliquam esse pacificationis inter <placeName ref="l2524">Scotos</placeName> et <placeName ref="l832">Gallum</placeName>, <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>praeterea pontificem cogitare post pascha <placeName ref="l306">Mediolanum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>venire ibique opperire <persName>Ferdinandum Caesarem</persName>, quem in <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>imperii possessionem coronatione sua mittat.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Haec omnia <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>te iam antea habere existimo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Tamen, quod tu iubeas me <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>scribere, haec apponenda duxi, ne vacuas et inanes mitterem.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>Legatus noster sperat se brevi missionem e rege posse <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>impetrare; dubitat, an rediturus sit.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Obtulit autem mihi <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>non semel iam, non regis, sed sui ipsius nomine opera <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>d. <persName ref="p18700">Augustini</persName> et praeterea unum aut alterum librum <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>quos apud me, amicum suum, <foreign xml:lang="el">μνημόσυνον</foreign> et pignus <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>amicitiae cupit relinquere aut etiam deponere, ut <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>olim rediens iis mecum in commune utatur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Ego quidem <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>agnosco hominis humanitatem et quidem hoc patre in primis <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>opus haberem.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">An vero mihi liceat per leges vestra<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>s, <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>subdubito, licet cohortaceum munus ab amico accipere f<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>as es<lb xml:id="p1z26"/>se existimem.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Accipit, ut puto, <persName ref="p1283">Gesnerus</persName> noster ab <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>amicis exteris eius generis plura, nec ipse si dat, propterea <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>gratis dat, qui omni mea bibliotheca, dum hic fuit, usus est, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>quae et ei et domesticis eius nunquam non patuit.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Ego vero <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>ne quid temere facerem, quod mihi postea fraudi <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>esse posset, te prius interrogandum duxi.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Tuum ergo super <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>hac re iudicium expecto.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">De equo vero quid statuendum?</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Der schmid hats 14 tag im stal gehan, darzuͦ 4 gantzer <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>wuchen an im ze artznen ghan; darfür heuscht er <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>1 cronen, vermeint dennoch hyeby, er halte uns gar <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>wolfeil.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Das rößle ist gar alt und hat nit mee dan <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>ein oug.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="de">Her <persName>Philipp</persName> haltet es am baren; der begärt gar <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>und gantz nütt; noch nüt tester minder gaat kosten <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>darüber, und hat das rößle kein kouff.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="de">Wend ir <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>nun das thier uns für thod und läbendig übergeben, <lb xml:id="p1z42"/>das wir daruß lösind, was mir mögind, wens glych <lb xml:id="p1z43"/>nun 4 fl. wäre, das man den schmid daruß bezale, <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>oder wend ir, das wir es abhin schickind und irs dan thür <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>oder wolfeil verkouffind?</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de">Da neemend die wal.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Illi junckheri, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>de quibus tu, multum promittunt, sed parum praestant; antiquum <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>enim obtinent: <foreign xml:lang="de">Verheißen ist adelich, halten bürisch.</foreign></s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>So ir das roß uns also übergäben wend, so schrybend allein mit <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>3 worten; wyter wöllend wir üch dan nit bemüyen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z7"/>Haec obiter.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salvum te cupiunt nostri omnes.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutem ex nobis dic<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>as tuis omnibus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l98">Curię</placeName> 19. februarii anno 1560.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de">Man müste ee luͦgen, obs der französisch herr <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>wölte kouffen; so ritte er daaruff in <placeName ref="l832">Franckrych</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la">Haec per iocum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8009">Ioannes Fabricius</persName> t<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>ui observantissimus.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">Clarissimo viro eruditione et pietate excellenti d. <persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bul<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>lingero</persName>, ecclesiae <placeName ref="l587">Tiguri<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>nae</placeName> antistiti vig<lb xml:id="p2z13"/>ilantissimo, <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>domino et patrono suo multum honorando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
</TEI>